-- Classic: visible Instance Portal (template 1100001, display 672) at vanilla dungeon/raid entrances that had none.
-- Positions are the AreaTrigger centres (hotfixes.area_trigger); sphere triggers sit 1.5 yd lower so the portal rests on the ground,
-- box triggers use the box centre Z. Onyxia's Lair (trigger 2848 is a client DB2 row, not in hotfixes) uses -4708,-3727,54.5 and needs an in-game look.
-- Already portalled and skipped: Deadmines, Shadowfang, Scholomance, Zul'Gurub, SM Graveyard/Library, Hall of Thanes.
